# ONE UPSTREAM WART, MEASURED AND REPORTED RATHER THAN WORKED AROUND: the tag
# `v0.2.4` has FOUR releases behind it, not one — the published one above plus
# THREE empty drafts (ids 381901817, 381901945, 381903799; `assets=0`,
# `published=null`). v0.2.3 has the identical shape (one published, three empty
